+    // fishpond patch 34: a defending battle (or planeswalker) that was defeated and left the battlefield mid-combat (Invasion of Ikoria:
+    // exiled, then cast transformed) is still listed as a defender; while it is being cast it is in no zone, so the
+    // lookahead copier can't map it and the copy threw ("Couldn't map <Nothing>", D7). It is no longer in combat, so the
+    // copy leaves it out, with the bands that attacked it (they deal no damage once it's gone).
+    private static boolean departedBattle(GameEntity e) {
+        return e instanceof Card c && !c.isInPlay();   // mid-cast the card has no state (not even its battle type)
+    }
+
